@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam ParticipantFontColor black

participant ":LogicManager" as Logic
participant ":EditRoleCommand" as Command
participant ":ModelManager" as Model
participant ":AddressBook" as AddressBook
participant ":StorageManager" as Storage

Logic -> Command : execute(model)
activate Command
note over Command
Successful execution path shown.
Parser has validated supplied fields.
Check displayed index and duplicate title.
end note
Command -> Model : setRole(target, editedRole)
activate Model
Model -> AddressBook : setRole(target, editedRole)
activate AddressBook
note over AddressBook
Validate role replacement before changing lists.
On rename, update every matching candidate,
including those outside the current filter.
Keep candidate details and role status.
end note
AddressBook --> Model
deactivate AddressBook
Model --> Command
deactivate Model
Command --> Logic : CommandResult
deactivate Command
Logic -> Storage : saveAddressBook(model.getAddressBook())
@enduml
